                        "entry_id": "c3f2751c-5d24-3a66-844d-206b4d6609f1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Decorated by glaze splashed or irregularly spread upon the surface, or apparently applied at the top and allowed to run down the sides."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
